<title>POLAND: AMERBANK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.79 vs    0.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.37 vs    1.01</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.01 vs    2.46</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.62 vs    3.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.50 vs    5.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   13.86 vs    7.89</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.32 vs   33.81</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	46.28 vs   40.33</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
